# The way into 2029 (docs/STORY.md §6), through the real keys. Once he knows his
# body has no past, the gate at his house is open: step into it, press use, and
# the same coast is 2029 on the same tile, with Hannah at the door at two in the
# morning. Nothing here is a coordinate: `at gate:ID` asks the story where the
# gate stands, and `at cast:NAME` where a person stands in whichever year he is in.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/before.tour --seed=1 --hour=2 --weather=clear:0 --beats=body_new
coast calm
wait 0.6

# --- the gate, standing in the ruin of his street ----------------------------------------
at gate:gate_home
wait 0.8
await era_gate:gate_home 3
shot 01-the-gate-in-the-ruin

# --- through it -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
press use
await before 5
wait 1.5
shot 02-the-same-street-in-2029

# --- Hannah, at the door of the house ------------------------------------------------------
at cast:hannah
wait 0.8
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
shot 03-hannah-at-two-in-the-morning with talking,cast:hannah
press pause
wait 0.5
await met:hannah 2
